 ew?usp=sharing\nIMG: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YyHT5t3iUXVsXR2NQqRx_
 ltvmWAnVTWJ/view?usp=sharing\n--\nSunday\, April 13 Area 09 Pre-Conference 
 Mock Conference 9:00am – 3:00pm PST (hybrid)\n\nSunday – April 13 – 8 am to
  3 pm – Day 2 is the Pre-Conference Mock Conference Assembly (https://docs.
 google.com/document/d/1IumG0J3vb89deTnAcKuiC4tsqqXAxQm5oZPj4XeNYWY/edit?usp
 =sharing) (English Agenda here).\n\nThe Pre-Mock Conference Workshop is a d
 ay where everyone involved has the fun opportunity to act like a delegate f
 or the day and deliberate on agenda items “in committee” – just like our de
 legate will do at the General Service Conference from April 27 to May 3!\n\
 nGSRs and AA individuals are randomly assigned 1 of 6 committees on the day
  of the event\, and DCMCs and Area Chairs are pre-assigned to 1 of the 6 co
 mmittees that was discussed at the March Area Service Committee. ( Reminder
 : GSRs who attended the March ASC and were assigned a committee breakout wi
 ll join the same committee on April 13). ( Please see the alternate delegat
 e’s page for access to the workgroup assignments . Password protected: Pane
 l74).\n\nThe outcome of this assembly will allow the delegate to know “ Are
 a 9’s group conscience” as discussed through the work group committees. Scr
 ibes of the Workgroup assignments will provide the committee’s recommendati
 on via the Survey Monkey (https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/D65XWZ7) /Workgrou
 p packet and share this information at the microphone. Workgroups will also
  have the opportunity to discuss three pre-assigned General Service Confere
 nce inventory questions (English – HERE (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/
 1FAIpQLScj_xJkUbXGcKs49o5nOdWazxV6a2YNOI3ZtLmK4iTrQHM1Bw/viewform?usp=heade
 r) Spanish – HERE (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScqsHuVLq2p8acr
 ggTpjNQYbwps8PicKqmWlNKN9IL1lMoQBQ/viewform?usp=header) ) and discuss the m
 otion t o approve the Spanish Translation of The Plain Language Big Book. (
 https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=https%3A%2F%2Fmsca09aa.or
 g%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FMotion-A-PLBB-in-Spanish.docx&wdOrig
 in=BROWSELINK)\n\nHosted by Alt Delegate\n\nPhysical location: Long Beach C
 ommunity College: 4901 East Carson Street\, Long Beach\, CA\, United States
 \n\nDomingo – 13 de abril – 8 am a 3 pm – El día 2 es la Asamblea Simulada 
 de Conferencia previa a la conferencia (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gB
 jExWjrboa1kviLrEAUMvXaoSgqtcao/view?usp=drive_link) (Agenda en espanol aquí
 ).\n\nEl Taller Pre-Simulado de la Conferencia es un día en el que todos lo
 s involucrados tienen la divertida oportunidad de actuar como delegados del
  día y deliberar sobre los temas de la agenda “en comité”\, ¡tal como lo ha
 rá nuestro delegado en la Conferencia de Servicios Generales del 27 de abri
 l al 3 de mayo!\n\nA los RSG y AA se les asigna aleatoriamente 1 de 6 comit
 és el día del evento\, y los DCMC y los coordinadores de área están preasig
 nados a 1 de los 6 comités que se discutieron en el Comité de Servicio de Á
 rea de marzo. ( Recordatorio: Los RSG que asistieron al ASC de marzo y se l
 es asignó un grupo de trabajo se unirán al mismo comité el 13 de abril). ( 
 Consulte la página del delegado suplente para acceder a las tareas del grup
 o de trabajo . Protegido por contraseña: Panel74).\n\n…
