UID:ct4hc51dc0h4r0ifa2skgikeos@google.com
CREATED:20261006T005238Z
DESCRIPTION:MSCA09|Workshop|Virtual\nLanguage: Bilingual\nZoomID: 870 5276 
 5457\nPasscode: Panel74\nIMG: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ir1d6ZnltLJj
 iqptjz7EBInRLpHViUo1/view?usp=sharing\n--\nVirtual ONLY\n\nSaturday – April
  12 – 10 am to 12 pm – D ay 1 is a GSR Group Conscience Workshop ( English 
 agenda here ) (https://drive.google.com/open?id=1EbnRb6mAygRW7JLTYZOtxYywHQ
 6hdazbLhNZtumjuMk)\n\nThis virtual workshop is an opportunity for GSRs to s
 hare their group’s voice (literally out loud) during an open sharing sessio
 n! Essentially\, this will be a time in which GSRs will verbally share how 
 their group feels about agenda items. GSRS should be involved as much as po
 ssible \, so we hope this first day will demonstrate that we are hearing th
 eir group’s conscience! (During the session\, the Delegate and Alternate De
 legate will take notes and the Delegate will answer any questions and/or pr
 ovide more clarification on items at the end of the session)! A very exciti
 ng day!\n\nSábado – 12 de abril – 10 am a 12 pm – El día 1 es un Taller de 
